#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `spouses` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the home is` `wholly exempt`
#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE TRUE `one individual` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the home is` `not exempt`
#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `a company or other body` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the home is` `not exempt`
#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `two or more other individuals` TRUE FALSE 50 EQUALS `the home is` `partly exempt`
#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `two or more other individuals` TRUE TRUE 50 EQUALS `the home is` `wholly exempt`
#ASSERT `How far is my home exempt as my primary residence` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `spouses` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the home is` (`Is my home exempt as my primary residence` `d084, the Nedlands house at 30 June 2063, as a record`)
#ASSERT `What share of my home is exempt` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `spouses` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `per cent` 100
#ASSERT `What share of my home is exempt` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `two or more other individuals` TRUE FALSE 50 EQUALS `per cent` 50
