#ASSERT `What share of my home is exempt` `as the owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE `two or more other individuals` TRUE FALSE 50 EQUALS `per cent` (`What percentage of my home is exempt` `half each with a sibling living elsewhere, as a record`)
