§§ `For the occupier`

-- s 45(1), (3): a lease putting the land tax on me cannot make me liable to the Commissioner, but binds us.
#ASSERT `Can my lease make me liable to the Commissioner for the land tax` `as the occupier` TRUE EQUALS no
